  "worked_solution": "The formula for the area of a circle is $A=\\pi {r}^{2}$, where $r$ is the radius. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\pi {r}^{2} \\\\ 36\\pi  & =\\pi {r}^{2} \\\\ 36\\cancel{\\pi } & =\\cancel{\\pi }{r}^{2} \\\\ {r}^{2} & =36 \\\\ r & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the diameter is\n\n$$\nd=2\\cdot r=2\\cdot 6=12.\n$$",
